# The eighth battle (stage 7) with the UPGRADES switch upgrade_lance_pursuit
# on, played hands-off: stage_07's start and its five stops, then no order.
# The player's 'Mech has lost its left leg by 07:38, and from 07:38:10 no
# unit on either side has a target; the last enemy (unit 19) never moves.
# A minute of that quiet on, the lance's acting leader is sent at unit 19
# (Tactical/UnitState.cpp, ApplyLancePursuitUpgrade), the third unit follows
# it, and the battle is won with no key pressed. The original, and the port
# with the switch off, wait there for ever (stage_07).
# set: campaign
# start-save: REVENGE_SAVE_STAGE_06
# upgrades: lance_pursuit
# Load Game, slot 1; the battle running.
idle:1000 Return idle:50 Right idle:50 Return idle:300
Return steps:2 @snap:stage7_battle
# The battle's stops, as in stage_07.
still:200 @snap:stage7_message1 Return idle:300
still:200 @snap:stage7_message2 Return idle:300
still:200 @snap:stage7_message3 Return idle:300
still:200 @snap:stage7_message4 Return idle:300
still:200 @snap:stage7_message5 Return idle:300
# 200 steps on (07:41): where stage_07 stands still, the lance is on its way.
steps:200 @snap:stage7_moving
# Hands-off to the end: unit 19 destroyed, the battle won.
still:200 @snap:stage7_won Return idle:300
# The transmission after it, its first page.
still:2000 @snap:stage7_after1
